{"ticker":"PNW","updated":"2026-10-30T23:06:39Z","profile":{"longName":"Pinnacle West Capital Corporation","shortName":"Pinnacle West Capital Corporati","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.pinnaclewest.com","fullTimeEmployees":6610,"marketCap":12880841728,"trailingPE":20.399231,"forwardPE":19.078154,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.319095,"pegRatio":3.82,"targetMeanPrice":104.96667,"targetHighPrice":119.5,"targetLowPrice":89.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.071,"earningsGrowth":-0.095,"grossMargins":0.43352002,"operatingMargins":0.21341999,"profitMargins":0.11525,"totalRevenue":5554253824,"beta":0.424,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":111.16,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":86.18,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.47},"summary":"Pinnacle West Capital Corporation, through its subsidiary, provides retail and wholesale electric services in the state of Arizona. The company engages in the generation, transmission, and distribution of electricity using nuclear, gas, oil, coal, and solar generating facilities. Its transmission facilities include overhead lines and underground lines; and distribution facilities consist of overhead lines and underground primary cables. The company also owns and maintains substations, including transmission and distribution yards; and owns energy storage facilities. Pinnacle West Capital Corporation was incorporated in 1985 and is headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona.","summary_zh":"Pinnacle West Capital Corporation 透過其子公司在亞利桑那州提供零售和批發電力服務。該公司利用核能、天然氣、石油、煤炭和太陽能發電設施從事發電、輸電和配電業務。其輸電設施包括架空線路和地下線路；配電設施由架空線路和地下主電纜組成。該公司還擁有並維護變電站，包括輸電場和配電場；並擁有能源儲存設施。 Pinnacle West Capital Corporation 成立於 1985 年，總部位於亞利桑那州鳳凰城。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":89.11,"h":89.27,"l":88.47,"c":88.8,"v":871500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":88.61,"h":89.3,"l":88.29,"c":88.73,"v":720900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o"