TEUwVU1GSzhCM09kd3lWMmpjNTRFTldLajVGSmV0a2xWMUNNdi1UMkNQQmJrdEcwQVJHdXpQYktWZVRJWXE3Q3FLbml0dncxM1dmUEZOT1Z4SmFkMm01X25WV05UMExzeEI?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"不斷增長的客戶需求會支持 PNW 的長期獲利成長嗎？"},{"title":"Pinnacle West Capital (PNW) Stock Sees Modest Fair Value Cut As Analysts Rework Targets","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNb0lsZUdfSHhIUUVXQ2pvYm9acXlZMUhLVldzWmRQNGFObkJuRmJnbXViNldVdzVrVko5a3ItbXU2dWtTOVJ5c3loVmYxMDdTSDdNb3Mtb1ZzeFBlVVI3dXBPVmd4SEJrZ0R3eHBUQzE4bjhhQUxmdFd6NjNDUUY0WDNHaFJRbEhrMTR1M1VKeFpzd2t2bG45ZlVTREk?oc=5","date":"2026-10-06","zh":"隨著分析師重新設定目標，Pinnacle West Capital (PNW) 股票公允價值小幅下調"},{"title":"Jefferies Adjusts Pinnacle West Capital Price Target to $109 From $129, Maintains Buy Rating","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOTVFiVkRuZ19TZ0FVRVlJZnF6andKVXpDOHk1WGJfVXBFOWpIcXlyLWVoYnlSSnlMYWJrRHNUeVlybHY5bEFLTEdqdGI2cWFFUzdqeGI5c2RpNkR0Nm4zVEFEZ0tnNks2a0U4N2pld3J0ZVhET21RVU1nS2lfMjJsRllFalZrdWU5U3JVTURYX2NjejlxajF1VUF4MS11RlJSeDUxbmNOYw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-05","zh":"傑富瑞將 Pinnacle West Capital 目標價從 129 美元調整至 109 美元，維持買入評級"}],"order_news":[],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764622/000076462226000011/pnw-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"with consolidated assets of approximately $30 billion. We derive essentially all of our revenues and earnings from our principal subsidiary, APS. Since 1886, APS and its affiliates have provided energy and energy-related products to people and businesses throughout Arizona. APS is Arizona's largest and longest-serving electric company and generates safe, affordable electricity in 11 of Arizona's 15 counties. Our other active subsidiaries are El Dorado and PNW Power.","zh":"合併資產約300億美元。我們的所有收入和收益基本上都來自我們的主要子公司 APS。自 1886 年以來，APS 及其附屬公司一直為亞利桑那州各地的人們和企業提供能源和能源相關產品。 APS 是亞利桑那州規模最大、服務時間最長的電力公司，為亞利桑那州 15 個縣中的 11 個縣提供安全、價格實惠的電力。我們其他活躍的子公司是 El Dorado 和 PNW Power。"},{"en":"Our reportable business segment is our regulated electricity segment, which consists of traditional regulated retail and wholesale electricity businesses (primarily electric service to Native Load customers) and related activities, and includes electricity generation, transmission, and distribution. Our reportable business segment activities are conducted primarily through our wholly-owned subsidiary, APS.","zh":"我們的可報告業務部門是受監管電力部門，由傳統受監管零售和批發電力業務（主要為本地負載客戶提供電力服務）和相關活動組成，包括發電、輸電和配電。我們的可報告業務部門活動主要透過我們的全資子公司 APS 進行。"},{"en":"APS currently provides electric service to approximately 1.4 million customers. We own or lease 6,257 MW of regulated generation capacity, and we hold a mix of both long-term and short-term PPAs for additional capacity. During 2025, no single purchaser or user of energy accounted for more than 1.9% of our electric revenues.","zh":"APS 目前為約 140 萬客戶提供電力服務。我們擁有或租賃 6,257 兆瓦的受管制發電容量，並持有長期和短期購電協議以增加容量。 2025 年期間，沒有任何一個能源購買者或用戶占我們電力收入的 1.9% 以上。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"APS currently provides electric service to approximately 1.4 million customers. We own or lease 6,257 MW of regulated generation capacity, and we hold a mix of both long-term and short-term PPAs for additional capacity. During 2025, no single purchaser or user of energy accounted for more than 1.9% of our electric revenues.","zh":"APS 目前為約 140 萬客戶提供電力服務。我們擁有或租賃 6,257 兆瓦的受管制發電容量，並持有長期和短期購電協議以增加容量。 2025 年期間，沒有任何一個能源購買者或用戶占我們電力收入的 1.9% 以上。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electricand Transmission Service","val":5319000000,"zh":"電力和輸電服務"},{"name":"Transmission Services","val":129667000,"zh":"傳輸服務"},{"name":"Wholesale","val":108661000,"zh":"批發的"},{"name":"Other Services","val":17355000,"zh":"其他服務"}],"total":5339939000}},"peers":["NI","LNT","DTE","PEG","CMS"]}}